# No secrets or services are required for this device-local prototype.
# Set a real HTTPS origin only when approved for a hosted preview or release.
# PUBLIC_SITE_URL=https://your-approved-domain.example
# GitHub Pages builds set these values together:
# PUBLIC_SITE_URL=https://chiragmirani.github.io
# NEXT_PUBLIC_BASE_PATH=/series65-flashcards-app
# Leave NEXT_PUBLIC_BASE_PATH empty for the local root preview.
# Indexing remains blocked in metadata and robots until a reviewed code change.
# The importer reads SERIES65_SOURCE_DIR from the shell, not this file.
# Example: C:/Users/chira/Desktop/sports/datascience
# Future server-only integrations belong behind lib/ports.ts. Never prefix secrets with NEXT_PUBLIC_.
